  "body": "## Result and review\nGives the complete all-degree characteristic-two Lie algebra for the source\u2019s natural seven-dimensional one-point extension and identifies the original coefficient-sequence gamma map as injective. Separate full source/algebra review passed, with 26,405 author and 166,464 independent exact controls. Xu\u2019s ring calculation, Hermann\u2019s structural results and related literature are credited. The natural nontrivial permutation module is explicit; no historical-priority or human peer-review claim is made.\n\nAll listed independent review files are retained unchanged.\n\n## Queue\nRecommended claimed_solved 2/5. Campaign coordinator will add the corresponding QUEUE.md row update to this branch.\n\nNo new human peer-review claim, merge or release requested.\n",
